{"ticker":"COHR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:41:21Z","profile":{"longName":"Coherent Corp.","shortName":"Coherent Corp.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"United States","website":"https://www.coherent.com","fullTimeEmployees":51478,"marketCap":41418563584,"trailingPE":51.048546,"forwardPE":15.121983,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.818701,"pegRatio":0.92,"targetMeanPrice":394.39853,"targetHighPrice":500.0,"targetLowPrice":230.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.337,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.37495998,"operatingMargins":0.118269995,"profitMargins":0.11309,"totalRevenue":7118180864,"beta":2.113,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":440.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":123.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Coherent Corp. develops, manufactures, and markets lasers, transceivers, other optical and optoelectronic devices, modules, and systems worldwide. Its products include critical components consisting of detectors, passive optics, thermal solutions, and PICS; silicon photonics and other advanced optical technologies; and coherent transmission components, transport products, optical amplifiers, passive optical components, optical line systems, and multi-rail platform. The company's Datacenter and Communications segment offers transceivers, co-packaged optics, and optical circuit switches, as well as other systems, such as subsystems, modules, and semiconductor devices for datacenter and communications applications; and VCSELS, EELS, pump lasers, and other components, optics, and ICs for datacenter and communication applications. Its Industrial segment offers excimer lasers, solid-state lasers, and CO2 lasers; laser systems for various industrial applications, including semiconductor capital equipment, display manufacturing, precision manufacturing, and scientific research; and laser systems and subsystems comprising high-power lasers for materials processing. This segment also provides engineered materials, laser optics, thermoelectric components, and advanced ceramic and metal-matrix composite materials and products. It markets its products and services through a direct sales for","summary_zh":"相干公司 (Coherent Corp.) 在全球開發、製造和銷售雷射、收發器、其他光學和光電設備、模組和系統。其產品包括由探測器、被動光學元件、熱解決方案和 PICS 組成的關鍵組件；矽光子學和其他先進光學技術；和相干傳輸組件、傳輸產品、光放大器、被動光組件、光線路系統和多軌平台。該公司的資料中心和通訊部門提供收發器、共同封裝光學元件和光路開關，以及其他系統，例如用於資料中心和通訊應用的子系統、模組和半導體元件；以及用於資料中心和通訊應用的 VCSELS、EELS、泵浦雷射以及其他元件、光學元件和 IC。其工業部門提供準分子雷射、固態雷射和 CO2 雷射；適用於各種工業應用的雷射系統，包括半導體資本設備、顯示器製造、精密製造和科學研究；包括用於材料加工的高功率雷射的雷射系統和子系統。該部門還提供工程材料、雷射光學、熱電元件以及先進陶瓷和金屬基複合材料和產品。它透過直接銷售來行銷其產品和服務","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"科學技術儀器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":87.11,"h":88.24,"l":85.94,"c":87.8,"v":4122500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":88.09,"h":89.97,"l":87.15,"c":88.47,"v":3760300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":90.5,"h":95.67,"l":90.0,"c":95.62,"v":5600300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":98.22,"h":100.82,"l":94.55,"c":97.84,"v":7214700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":98.79,"h":99.9,"l":96.82,"c":98.67,"v":2941200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":99.08,"h":99.32,"l":95.5,"c":99.22,"v":2790100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":102.65,"h":106.8,"l":102.16,"c":103.49,"v":5020100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":102.54,"h":106.0,"l":101.64,"c":103.51,"v":3944100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":101.61,"h":103.92,"l":101.2,"c":102.99,"v":3475300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":103.53,"h":108.05,"l":101.38,"c":106.34,"v":4235200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":106.7,"h":107.35,"l":102.87,"c":104.47,"v":3712600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":104.33,"h":104.4,"l":100.63,"c":103.41,"v":3901100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":106.33,"h":108.39,"l":105.12,"c":108.05,"v":3659700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":107.91,"h":109.74,"l":106.96,"c":109.11,"v":3427000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":109.0,"h":115.34,"l":108.8,"c":114.6,"v":4579000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":115.0,"h":115.0,"l":108.01,"c":109.29,"v":3488300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":110.03,"h":110.13,"l":104.78,"c":106.52,"v":3291700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":102.72,"h":107.79,"l":102.14,"c":106.5